---

This project has no bundled third-party source. It is stdlib-only Python and
shells out to tools the user installs and authenticates themselves (git, and
optionally the GitHub CLI and Tailscale). Distributable desktop bundles built
with the recipe in git-sync-suggester/packaging/ embed a CPython runtime, which
carries its own PSF license.
